sipa_delegate: an "already active" power domain is success (pm_runtime_resume_and_get), a failure is answered instead of spun on, runtime PM is on before the connection thread starts

Same fix as upstream/modules (docs/FINDINGS.md 31f): pm_runtime_get_sync() returns 1 when the device is active
already, and the vendor loop took any non-zero value for a failure and retried every millisecond for ever - a
soft lockup panic in dele-4-5 (seen at a 6.18 shutdown on the U30 Air).

--- a/drivers/net/sprd/sipa_delegate/sipa_dele_cp_in_ap.c	2026-10-05 03:01:27
+++ b/drivers/net/sprd/sipa_delegate/sipa_dele_cp_in_ap.c	2026-10-05 03:01:51
